{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":22,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician upon Aijeleth Shahar, A Psalm of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 22:1"},"My God, my God, why hast thou forsaken me? ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["why art thou so "]},"far from helping me, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and from"]}," the words of my roaring? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 22:2"},"O my God, I cry in the daytime, but thou hearest not; and in the night season, and am not silent. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 22:3"},"But thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," holy, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["O thou"]}," that inhabitest the praises of Israel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 22:4"},"Our fathers trusted in thee: they trusted, and thou didst deliver them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 22:5"},"They cried unto thee, and were delivered: they trusted in thee, and were not confounded. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 22:6"},"But I ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["am"]}," a worm, and no man; a reproach of men, and despised of the people. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 22:7"},"All they that see me laugh me to scorn: they shoot out the lip, they shake the head ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["saying,"]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 22:8"},"He trusted on the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," he would deliver him: let him deliver him, seeing he delighted in him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 22:9"},"But thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," he that took me out of the womb: thou didst make me hope ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["when I was"]}," upon my mother’s breasts. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 22:10"},"I was cast upon thee from the womb: thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," my God from my mother’s belly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 22:11"},"Be not far from me; for trouble ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," near; for ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is "]},"none to help. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 22:12"},"Many bulls have compassed me: strong ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["bulls"]}," of Bashan have beset me round. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 22:13"},"They gaped upon me ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with"]}," their mouths, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," a ravening and a roaring lion. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 22:14"},"I am poured out like water, and all my bones are out of joint: my heart is like wax; it is melted in the midst of my bowels. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 22:15"},"My strength is dried up like a potsherd; and my tongue cleaveth to my jaws; and thou hast brought me into the dust of death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 22:16"},"For dogs have compassed me: the assembly of the wicked have inclosed me: they pierced my hands and my feet. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 22:17"},"I may tell all my bones: they look ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," stare upon me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 22:18"},"They part my garments among them, and cast lots upon my vesture. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 22:19"},"But be not thou far from me, O LORD: O my strength, haste thee to help me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 22:20"},"Deliver my soul from the sword; my darling from the power of the dog. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 22:21"},"Save me from the lion’s mouth: for thou hast heard me from the horns of the unicorns. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 22:22"},"I will declare thy name unto my brethren: in the midst of the congregation will I praise thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:22"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PSA 22:23"},"Ye that fear the LORD, praise him; all ye the seed of Jacob, glorify him; and fear him, all ye the seed of Israel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:23"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PSA 22:24"},"For he hath not despised nor abhorred the affliction of the afflicted; neither hath he hid his face from him; but when he cried unto him, he heard. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:24"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PSA 22:25"},"My praise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," of thee in the great congregation: I will pay my vows before them that fear him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:25"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PSA 22:26"},"The meek shall eat and be satisfied: they shall praise the LORD that seek him: your heart shall live for ever. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:26"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PSA 22:27"},"All the ends of the world shall remember and turn unto the LORD: and all the kindreds of the nations shall worship before thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:27"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PSA 22:28"},"For the kingdom ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the LORD’S: and he ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the governor among the nations. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:28"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PSA 22:29"},"All ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["they that be"]}," fat upon earth shall eat and worship: all they that go down to the dust shall bow before him: and none can keep alive his own soul. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:29"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PSA 22:30"},"A seed shall serve him; it shall be accounted to the Lord for a generation. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:30"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PSA 22:31"},"They shall come, and shall declare his righteousness unto a people that shall be born, that he hath done ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["this."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 22:31"}]}]}
